<< /Length 4175 >>
stream
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 738.0 Td (call tree. Each severity maps to a defined set of contacts and an escalation chain:) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 718.0 Td (1. SOC lead notifies the on-call CSIRT Incident Commander.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 704.0 Td (2. The IC engages required responders \(forensics, IT, application owners\).) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 690.0 Td (3. For Sev-1/Sev-2, the IC notifies the CISO, Legal, and Communications within 30 minutes.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 676.0 Td (4. Regulatory and customer notification obligations \(e.g., GDPR 72-hour reporting\) are managed by) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 662.0 Td (the Legal/Communications liaison.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 642.0 Td (The call tree, including primary and backup contacts and their 24x7 details, is maintained in the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 628.0 Td (CSIRT contact directory and validated quarterly.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 602.0 Td (6. Containment, Eradication, and Recovery) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 579.0 Td (Response follows a structured lifecycle:) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 559.0 Td (- Containment - Short-term actions to limit spread: network isolation of affected hosts, VLAN) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 545.0 Td (  quarantine, blocking malicious IPs/domains/hashes at the firewall and proxy, disabling) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 531.0 Td (  compromised accounts, and revoking tokens. HPE prioritizes containment that preserves forensic) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 517.0 Td (  value where feasible.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 503.0 Td (- Eradication - Removal of the threat: deleting malware, closing exploited vulnerabilities,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 489.0 Td (  rotating credentials, and rebuilding compromised systems from trusted images.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 475.0 Td (- Recovery - Restoring systems to production from validated backups, monitoring for reinfection,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 461.0 Td (  and confirming normal operations before closing the incident.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 435.0 Td (7. Forensics, Evidence, and Chain of Custody) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 412.0 Td (The Forensics Lead directs evidence collection and preservation according to strict standards.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 398.0 Td (Volatile data is captured first, followed by disk and memory imaging using write-blockers and) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 384.0 Td (forensically sound tooling. All artifacts are hashed, logged, and stored in secured evidence) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 370.0 Td (lockers. A documented chain of custody records every transfer and handler to ensure admissibility) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 356.0 Td (should the incident lead to litigation or law enforcement referral. Forensics analysis supports root) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 342.0 Td (cause determination and attribution.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 316.0 Td (8. Playbooks, Runbooks, and Procedures) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 293.0 Td (Responders execute standardized playbooks and runbooks mapped to common scenarios - ransomware,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 279.0 Td (business email compromise, insider threat, DDoS, cloud account compromise, and data exfiltration.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 265.0 Td (Each response plan documents step-by-step procedures, decision points, required tooling, and) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 251.0 Td (rollback criteria. Playbooks are version-controlled and updated as new tactics emerge, ensuring) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 237.0 Td (consistent, repeatable response regardless of which analyst is on shift.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 211.0 Td (9. Response Metrics, SLAs, and KPIs) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 188.0 Td (HPE measures response effectiveness using defined metrics and KPIs reported monthly to leadership:) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 168.0 Td (- MTTD \(Mean Time to Detect\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 154.0 Td (- MTTR \(Mean Time to Respond/Recover\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 140.0 Td (- Time-to containment and time-to-eradication) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 126.0 Td (- Percentage of incidents meeting SLA targets by severity) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 112.0 Td (- False-positive rate and escalation accuracy) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 92.0 Td (Sev-1 incidents carry the most aggressive SLA thresholds. Trend analysis of these KPIs drives tuning) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 78.0 Td (of detections and resourcing.) Tj ET
endstream
